{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41615463\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅为神经运动控制年会的综合性导读，缺少摘要且无法确认涉及STN神经活动或FOG的具体证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41615860\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究时间限制训练对PD反应时和步态速度的影响，未评估FOG或STN神经活动，不能回答二者关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41621006\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"聚焦GBA1基因型和发病年龄对PD临床表型的影响，未研究FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41625543\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然涉及PD双任务训练和经颅电刺激，但荟萃分析没有FOG特异性结局或STN神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41631726\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述聚焦聚焦超声治疗及PD分子和环路病理，未提供STN神经活动与FOG关系的针对性证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41637203\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD-FOG患者的皮层tDCS联合康复效果，可提供非STN皮层调控对FOG影响的对照证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41639440\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过大样本多模态影像和神经记录揭示STN等DBS靶点与躯体-认知行动网络的连接及治疗相关变化，可支持STN通过广泛脑网络影响PD运动症状的机制解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41645156\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"这是SMA-rTMS治疗PD-FOG的试验方案而非结果研究，尚无实证数据可用于比较STN与其他脑区的FOG机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41661363\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然讨论小脑与基底节之间的解剖和功能联系，但没有涉及PD冻结步态或STN相关的具体证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41663457\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究iRBD向突触核蛋白病转化的步态标志物，未涉及PD-FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41663997\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"关注PD合并阻塞性睡眠呼吸暂停的步态筛查，没有FOG特异性分析或STN神经信号。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41665260\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"评估增强现实康复对PD一般步态和平衡的影响，没有FOG特异性结局或神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41673148\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然揭示小鼠纹状体多巴胺对运动轨迹误差的编码，但未涉及PD、FOG或STN，无法建立与研究问题足够直接的机制联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41680227\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"开放数据集虽包含PD患者步态、DBS状态和临床资料，但没有STN神经记录或明确的FOG相关分析。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41682354\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究神经系统疾病患者的跌倒风险与步态参数关系，PD组未发现显著相关结果，且没有FOG或STN神经活动指标。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41686671\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要开发和验证PD鞋内步态评估系统，虽然提及FOG迹象，但没有研究FOG事件与STN神经活动之间的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41686905\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"记录皮层和苍白球活动以识别PD患者步行状态，但未区分FOG事件且没有STN神经记录。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41689277\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究晚期PD患者停用STN-DBS后的临床风险收益，但没有分析FOG或STN神经活动信号。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41692525\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅为PD人工智能可穿戴康复研究的范围综述方案，没有研究结果且不聚焦FOG或STN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41706712\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究视觉输入和注意负荷对PD步态启动及预期姿势调整的影响，但没有研究冻结事件或STN神经活动，属于邻近的非FOG步态证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41714177\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较PD-FOG与非FOG患者的静息态EEG特征，提供FOG相关脑电表型证据，可用于与STN局部活动及全脑网络机制进行比较。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41718129\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究大鼠纹状体损伤后的基底节-小脑网络代偿，但未建立PD-FOG模型，也没有STN相关测量，机制联系过于间接。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41718565\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较PD-FOG与CSVD-FOG的PET代谢和多巴胺转运体特征，提供FOG相关纹状体及多巴胺通路证据，有助于界定PD特异性神经机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41741462\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究直接利用STN beta活动实施自适应DBS并评估步态获益，可为STN振荡活动与步态障碍之间的关系提供临床证据，尽管没有单独报告FOG结局。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41760132\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"在PD-FOG患者中同步记录步行EEG并发现冻结发生前的beta频段网络组织改变，直接提供FOG发生前的神经动力学证据，可与STN beta活动机制进行比较。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6befe2fd-91df-42fa-87b7-281976441cc9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T135724424258Z", "elapsed_seconds": 194.86, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T14:00:39.302241+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "655f1b4b430b204f521414d9ba7db4c2fcbb69411cd820d702ea30f59f3cddc5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T135724424258Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4c15dea89943766e76394a97920dfdc377e687120c6d8bc698667b5d95dbd548"}}}
